sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Anyone as Public User / Verifier
    participant Browser as Mobile / Desktop Browser
    participant Gateway as Backend API Gateway
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
    actor Patient as Patient (Owner)

    Note over Anyone,Browser: Verifier scans physical/PDF QR Code
    Browser->>Gateway: GET /api/verify/:token
    Gateway->>Gateway: Compute SHA-256(token)
    Gateway->>DB: Query VerificationToken (expires 90d)
    alt Token Invalid or Expired
        DB-->>Gateway: Null record
        Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 404 "Invalid or Expired Verification Token"
    else Token Valid
        DB-->>Gateway: Token doc (consultationId, patientNicHash)
        Gateway->>DB: Fetch Consultation (Hospital, Doctor Name, Date)
        DB-->>Gateway: Sanitized consultation details
        Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 Public Authenticity Card (ZERO Patient PII)
    end

    opt Patient History Download Gate
        Patient->>Browser: Enters Patient NIC into secure verification modal
        Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/verify/:token/history-pdf { nic: "..." }
        Gateway->>Gateway: Hash input NIC with constant salt
        Gateway->>Gateway: Constant-Time String Comparison against patientNicHash
        alt NIC Mismatch
            Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 403 "Identification Verification Failed" (Rate limited)
        else NIC Matched
            Gateway->>DB: Fetch complete patient history timeline
            Gateway->>Gateway: Generate cumulative history PDF (WinAnsi typography)
            Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 application/pdf (%PDF- stream)
        end
    end
